WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.325
Every element is a box: content, padding, border, margin

2
00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:09.729
Every element is a box. The words in the middle, in blue, are its content.

3
00:00:10.408 --> 00:00:14.008
padding (green) adds space inside, around the content.

4
00:00:14.809 --> 00:00:17.759
border (gold) is the line around the padding.

5
00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:22.484
margin (orange) is space outside the border, between boxes.

6
00:00:23.209 --> 00:00:28.809
Width sets the content only, so with padding and border the box is 250 wide.
